- `DockDocumentTitle.tsx`: add Copy link and Copy as Markdown to the title menu's action list. No document-level implementation exists yet; decide first what a copied link is (the canonical Context URI such as `scratch://@arc-one/beats.md`, or an app URL) and how Markdown is read from the live session.
- `../context/viewers/ReadOnlyViewerFrame.tsx`: it paints `bg-background`, which a binary file shown in the dock draws against the dock's material. Make it transparent when the host is the dock. No Scratch file reaches it today.
- `core/editor/images/image-upload-presence.ts`: each editor publishes its whole `imageUploads` array, so with two views of one document both uploading at once, one view's update overwrites the other's announcement and peers see the first upload as abandoned. Needs two simultaneous uploads from two views; if it ever matters, combine each view's contribution at the session boundary.
